# Dev-only until release

Until the user explicitly says otherwise:

- Treat **development / `www.dev.sume.com` / Railway `development`** as the
  only environment for Studio Agent cutover, smoke, flags, and ops.
- Do **not** enable production feature flags, production cutovers, or production
  releases for Studio Agent work.
- Production release comes **much later**, after the agent is considered
  complete. Do not push for prod release while iterating on the agent.

When checking DB/migrations, Redis, poll-worker, or Vercel env for this work,
default to **development / non-prod**, not production.
